{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1323742-aeon-map-error","id":1323742,"title":"Aeon map error?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum","Trinity Continuum: \u00c6on"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-07-11T12:11:33-07:00","id":1323742,"title":"Aeon map error?","content":"The world map shows a large corrupted zone in Argentina and nothing in Venezuela, while in the text Venezuela has the corrupted zone, and not much is mentioned of Argentina.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11560-teerunner","name":"Teerunner","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-11T13:56:27-07:00","id":1323769,"title":"","content":"It mention the corrupted are in Argentina, not much for sure.<br /> <br /> The Venezuelan area is not corrupted, it\u2019s actually populated by hiperevolved creatures. Ok they were hiperevolved by the action of Aberrants, but the area is not rich in Flux, it\u2019s full of creatures from all kinds that really want to kill all humans, including plants and all things alive.<br /> <br /> They transmit a disease that looks like corruption, but it\u2019s not exactaly...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-11T14:56:29-07:00","id":1323781,"title":"","content":"Are you sure you\u2019re reading the current PDF? The Venezuelan plaguelands are listed as a medium corrupted zone in New Rules.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11560-teerunner","name":"Teerunner","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-12T07:35:21-07:00","id":1323951,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1323742-aeon-map-error?p=1323769#post1323769\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It mention the corrupted are in Argentina, not much for sure.<br /> <br /> The Venezuelan area is not corrupted, it\u2019s actually populated by hiperevolved creatures. Ok they were hiperevolved by the action of Aberrants, but the area is not rich in Flux, it\u2019s full of creatures from all kinds that really want to kill all humans, including plants and all things alive.<br /> <br /> They transmit a disease that looks like corruption, but it\u2019s not exactaly...</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> You did read the write up on Venezuela, right? It says right in the very first sentence that during the Aberrant War, a Nova created a vast zone of Quantum Flux... so yes... it is very rich in Flux. Unlike the Wycoff Blight however, this Flux doesn't retard the growth of life, but accelerates it out of control... causing rampant evolutionary mutations... with the Flux being able to be passed on as a disease to anyone attacked by the flora and fauna. It isn't a disease that acts like Corruption... it is Corruption that acts like a disease. All the other dangers of a Quantum Flux Zone remain in effect as well.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>There are three types of people in the world... those who can count and those who can't.<br /> I reject your reality and substitute my own!","edited":{"userid":2243,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2243-shadowstripe","user":"Shadowstripe","date":". 07-12-2019, 10:37 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2243-shadowstripe","name":"Shadowstripe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2243_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"344"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-12T07:54:35-07:00","id":1323954,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> It is similar to Wycoff\u2019s Blight, but rather than laying waste to the land, it mutated the flora and fauna into monsters that promptly attacked the human population and transmitted Corruption like a virulent disease </div> </div> </div>Ok, it\u2019s a corrupted zone, for sure, but the point is that the problem is not in the area itself but in the creatures living in it.<br /> <br /> It should be marked in the map, for sure, but it\u2019s not fixed in a place, it\u2019s contained by the barriers they build to contain the creatures. In 2104 the psi explosion reduced the corruption in the creatures, reducing the area covered by the corrupted creatures and the contagious effect of the creatures.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-13T22:56:28-07:00","id":1324363,"title":"","content":"Hrm... Actually looking at the map, shouldn't the Wycoff Blight be smaller now? In 2104 the zone was supposed to have shrunk by 1/3. But looking at the big splotch, it looks like it's still got a 1000 kilometer radius.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date"